==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{term|ethnic}} + {{term|cleansing}}. Perhaps compare {{etyl|sh}} {{term|etničko čišćenje}}, though this is probably attested later. Originally used of (and still chiefly associated with) the wars in former Yugoslavia during the 1990s.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|sg=[[ethnic]] [[cleansing]]}}

# The [[mass]] [[extermination]] or [[expulsion]] of [[people]] belonging to one ethnic or [[religious]] [[group]] by those of another.

